<td class="image"><img src="{{f:79777684}}" alt="A group of four individuals engaged in a discussion, with a middle-aged man animatedly gesturing while explaining something, as two women and a young man listen attentively, surrounded by informational posters in a bright, modern setting." width="880" height="495" /></td>
</tr>
