</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><a href="/ai-cybersecurity-computing/documents/2nd-reu-symposium-program-web.pdf">Access the Program</a></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>PARKING</h3>
<p>Parking information will be emailed to those who RSVP. The USF BullRunner has a stop
near the venue. </p>
