<td class="image"><img src="{{f:79777683}}" alt="A group of four students observes a presentation at an academic poster session, where one student is actively explaining her research on strategies for film-based publication, standing next to a detailed poster while the others listen attentively, holding boxes in their hands. The setting features a modern indoor space with awards displayed on the wall in the background." width="653" height="436" /></td>
</tr>
